# Base domain allowlist for job containers.
# One domain per line. Leading dot means "this domain and all subdomains."
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Per-job extras go in jobs/<job-name>/.domains (same format).
# The runner merges base + per-job domains at container startup.

# Core APIs
.anthropic.com
.slack.com
.googleapis.com
.google.com
.gstatic.com

# Claude Code CLI dependencies
.githubusercontent.com
.github.com

# Telemetry / observability
.datadoghq.com
